        values=[
          Constant(value='{\n  "canonical_form": "\\"\\"\\"\\nResume Generation Engine v14.36\\nAPI Client Initialization Fix: Proper Error Handling for Failed Gemini Client\\nThis version fixes an AttributeError where code attempted to call methods on a None\\nGeminiWebSearchClient. The issue occurred when the GenerativeModel initialization\\nfailed but the exception was caught and self.client was set to None, allowing the\\nobject to be created in a broken state.\\nKey Changes from v14.35:\\n1. Fixed GeminiWebSearchClient.__init__ to raise exception instead of continuing\\n- Changed line 1698 from setting self.client = None to re-raising exception\\n- Ensures failed initialization prevents object creation\\n- Prevents downstream AttributeError: \'NoneType\' object has no attribute \'search_and_analyze\'\\n2. This allows the proper exception handling in EnhancedJobDescriptionAnalyzer\\nto catch the failure and set self.gemini_client = None appropriately\\nThe issue manifested as:\\nAttributeError: \'NoneType\' object has no attribute '),
